<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Research on HEUSSER.PRO</title><link>https://heusser.pro/categories/research/</link><description>Recent content in Research on HEUSSER.PRO</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 18:17:51 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://heusser.pro/categories/research/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Exploring Shared Call History for Microsoft Teams Call Queues</title><link>https://heusser.pro/p/exploring-shared-call-history-for-microsoft-teams-call-queues-vrnzevrogniq/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 18:17:51 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://heusser.pro/p/exploring-shared-call-history-for-microsoft-teams-call-queues-vrnzevrogniq/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://heusser.pro/p/exploring-shared-call-history-for-microsoft-teams-call-queues-vrnzevrogniq/cover.png" alt="Featured image of post Exploring Shared Call History for Microsoft Teams Call Queues" />&lt;p>It&amp;rsquo;s been a while since I&amp;rsquo;ve written something about Teams Phone. And it&amp;rsquo;s been almost two years since I&amp;rsquo;ve published my &lt;a class="link" href="https://heusser.pro/p/get-missed-call-notifications-for-teams-call-queues-free-community-solution-cozo3bhojb7t/" >make-shift solution&lt;/a> for getting notified about missed calls in call queues.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Since then, Microsoft finally &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.microsoft.com/de-ch/microsoft-365/roadmap?filters=&amp;amp;searchterms=530579" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>shipped&lt;/a> shared call history in Queues app in January 2026. I was still traveling the world at this time so it took me a while to finally catch up.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="the-elephant-in-the-room">The Elephant in the Room
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>I just have to mention it again. I&amp;rsquo;m extremely disappointed that it took Microsoft this long to ship a basic calling feature like shared call history and that they made this a feature of Teams Premium.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="shared-calls-experience-in-queues-app">Shared Calls Experience in Queues App
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>But that&amp;rsquo;s not even the whole story. While it&amp;rsquo;s finally possible to see missed calls in a queue now, Teams still doesn&amp;rsquo;t notify people about them. It&amp;rsquo;s still a &lt;em>reactive&lt;/em> process. Somebody has to go into the Queues app and check for missed calls periodically.&lt;/p>
