loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Missed call in Queues app"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="175"
data-flex-basis="420px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>The &lt;strong>Shared calls&lt;/strong> tab also lists answered calls including who answered a call.&lt;/p>
