>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="missed-calls-resolution">Missed Calls Resolution
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>Missed calls carry an additional property for their resolution state. Call queue agents can then update the status of a call from &lt;code>Unresolved&lt;/code> to &lt;code>In-progress&lt;/code> or &lt;code>Resolved&lt;/code>. Call history entries will also display a badge pill next indicating their status next to the caller number.&lt;/p>
