&lt;h3 id="queues-without-shared-call-history">Queues without Shared Call History
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>Call queues that are not set up for shared call history will still display &lt;strong>Calls&lt;/strong> as tab title and display the tab on the left side. For some weird reason, the two tabs swap positions when shared call history is enabled. What&amp;rsquo;s even weirder is that one of my queues changed from &lt;strong>Calls&lt;/strong> to &lt;strong>Shared calls&lt;/strong> but kept the tab on the left.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://heusser.pro/p/exploring-shared-call-history-for-microsoft-teams-call-queues-vrnzevrogniq/image-5.png"
