&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">NotifyAgents&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">$cq&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="py">Agents&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">Where-Object&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">$_&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="py">OptIn&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-eq&lt;/span> &lt;span class="vm">$true&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">Select-Object&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">-ExpandProperty&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">ObjectId&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>The two objects that the script spits out include everything one would need to then loop over the missed call chats to check if there are any new missed calls.&lt;/p>
